[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    22[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    23[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Axis 2 — full set of public entry points (including the lowest-level one)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    24[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
