[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Axis 3 — input shapes the C special-cases
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Branch points that distinguish shapes (`driver.c:32` and `driver.c:44`), plus
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m the constants `100` / `99` from `driver.c:40-43`:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    43[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    44[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `driver`: the accepted window is the signed range `[0, 99]`, split by the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    45[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   distinguishable sub-shapes **empty (0)**, **one (1)**, **many (2..98)**, and
