[49m[38;5;10m+      1[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // Shared differential-test harness.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      2[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      3[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // Both the C `.so` and the Rust `.so` are loaded with `libloading` and driven
